{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_6B8EBC14","title":"Lois says hey","entry":"Dlg_6B8EBC14::entry","exit":"Dlg_6B8EBC14::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_F55E0C95","articyId":"72057624102702020","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lois Gyo","text":"Hey, heard you're going to take on the noodle stand. Thanks for keeping the place open.","speakerId":"Ntt_36265A9E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, heard you're going to take on the noodle stand. Thanks for keeping the place open.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50392","byteOffset":33404296,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_17E1237E","articyId":"72057624102702035","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lois Gyo","text":"I just realized you're the first real person I've talked to this week. And, don't take this the wrong way, but that is really fucking depressing.","speakerId":"Ntt_36265A9E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I just realized you're the first real person I've talked to this week. And, don't take this the wrong way, but that is really fucking depressing.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35421","byteOffset":25760216,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_BF9B6CE7","articyId":"72057624102702045","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lois Gyo","text":"Unsociable hours. I'm a game developer.","speakerId":"Ntt_36265A9E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Unsociable hours. I'm a game developer.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49627","byteOffset":33116952,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_9502B147","articyId":"72057624102702060","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lois Gyo","text":"It's the worst. I hate almost everything I make.","speakerId":"Ntt_36265A9E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's the worst. I hate almost everything I make.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36054","byteOffset":27986784,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_829DC592","articyId":"72057624102702065","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lois Gyo","text":"It is. Mostly.","speakerId":"Ntt_36265A9E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It is. Mostly.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39991","byteOffset":29458536,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_E7F25C02","articyId":"72057624102702080","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lois Gyo","text":"In my free time I can make some indie stuff. In fact, that's all I really care about. You might have played some of my games.","speakerId":"Ntt_36265A9E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"In my free time I can make some indie stuff. In fact, that's all I really care about. You might have played some of my games.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43915","byteOffset":30948064,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_D318D418","articyId":"72057624102702090","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lois Gyo","text":"The Lightness of a Shattered Heart? Darkness And Despair Quest? Crimson Freeways Across My Wrists? The Void of Desolation? Super Bunny Block Jumper 3?","speakerId":"Ntt_36265A9E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The Lightness of a Shattered Heart? Darkness And Despair Quest? Crimson Freeways Across My Wrists? The Void of Desolation? Super Bunny Block Jumper 3?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24477","byteOffset":17137400,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_DC9FCBCD","articyId":"72057624102702105","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lois Gyo","text":"It's about borderline personality disorder.","speakerId":"Ntt_36265A9E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's about borderline personality disorder.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35066","byteOffset":25626352,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_64215737","articyId":"72057624102702115","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lois Gyo","text":"Sounds depressing, right? Believe me, it's nothing compared to the shit the corps make me work on in my day job.","speakerId":"Ntt_36265A9E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sounds depressing, right? Believe me, it's nothing compared to the shit the corps make me work on in my day job.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48447","byteOffset":32663536,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_58D49BB3","articyId":"72057624102702125","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lois Gyo","text":"Yesterday I spent eight hours working on an in-game cosmetic item for WarZoner: Conquest Champions of the Battleground.","speakerId":"Ntt_36265A9E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yesterday I spent eight hours working on an in-game cosmetic item for WarZoner: Conquest Champions of the Battleground.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":4800.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31271","byteOffset":19709648,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_63B3A325","articyId":"72057624102702135","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lois Gyo","text":"Golden armor for your war camel. It costs five million Lims.","speakerId":"Ntt_36265A9E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Golden armor for your war camel. It costs five million Lims.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5400.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23020","byteOffset":16593608,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_6E8A30DA","articyId":"72057624102702150","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lois Gyo","text":"It gets worse. If you don't buy the golden camel armor then your camel gets killed in a cut scene and there's an unskippable three hour death animation.","speakerId":"Ntt_36265A9E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It gets worse. If you don't buy the golden camel armor then your camel gets killed in a cut scene and there's an unskippable three hour death animation.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6000.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35152","byteOffset":25659456,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_D29B1698","articyId":"7205762410270